abstract: |
  Persian Quote API is an open, academic-grade platform for Persian literature.
  It provides a canonical corpus of more than 5,000 works (classical Divan-e
  Hafez, modern poetry, aphorisms) with stable hierarchical identifiers,
  poem-structure analysis (colophon, stanza/line splitting, letter-fingerprint
  verification), a zero-dependency high-performance API engine (Tigh v1), hybrid
  Persian-aware search (BM25F, SymSpell fuzzy, Finglish transliteration, qafiyeh
  rhyme finding), and a programmable web component. Designed for researchers,
  students, and developers working with Persian literary texts.
